{"title":"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 8","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The smaller root of the equation \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/c/b0cdd444d3522f342a25fd1da25b80d303700e4d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(x-\\frac{3}{4}\\right)\\left(x-\\frac{3}{4}\\right)+\\left(x-\\frac{3}{4}\\right)\\left(x-\\frac{1}{2}\\right) =0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"348\" height=\"43\" /> is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/d/29d7bcc72a67c2b3faedc616c12c8258851b4207.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ -\\frac{3}{4}\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\frac{1}{2}\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac{5}{8}\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac{3}{4}\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"386\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Notice that \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/0/54051165fa11defa638a192b9e741ddce17e00c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(x-\\frac{3}{4}\\right)\\left(x-\\frac{3}{4}\\right)+\\left(x-\\frac{3}{4}\\right)\\left(x-\\frac{1}{2}\\right) = \\left(x - \\frac{3}{4}\\right)\\left(x - \\frac{3}{4} + x - \\frac{1}{2}\\right) = \\left(x - \\frac{3}{4}\\right)\\left(2x - \\frac{5}{4}\\right) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"770\" height=\"45\" />\n</p><p>The roots of this equation are therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/1/e1150a17bf1b733cb666be84d920c71fc96bb3f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"11\" height=\"38\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/3/f4344e4ce1c2a266b885d9b160544e3036de15f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{5}{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" />, the smaller of which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/2/a4253990ea1983a7f0928fbececf54e99d6f21ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac{5}{8}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"60\" height=\"49\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME\" title=\"1964 AHSME\">1964 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1964 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1964\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_